1
00:00:16,733 --> 00:00:20,939
Hasten to battle, men of Bayamo!

2
00:00:20,990 --> 00:00:25,248
The motherland looks proudly to you;

3
00:00:25,282 --> 00:00:29,369
Do not fear a glorious death,

4
00:00:29,471 --> 00:00:32,837
Because to die for the motherland is to live

5
00:00:34,005 --> 00:00:37,861
To live in chains is to live,

6
00:00:38,373 --> 00:00:42,485
In dishonor and ignominy,

7
00:00:42,785 --> 00:00:46,808
Hear the call of the bugle:

8
00:00:47,033 --> 00:00:50,267
Hasten, brave ones, to arms!